{\pard\sa120 Lifting floor to waist: 15 kg occasional. Overhead work not yet tolerated. He says sleep is still broken and that he is "fed up and not himself"; I have suggested he raise this with Dr. Kowbel.\par}
{\pard\sb180\sa80\b\fs24 Return to work\par}
{\pard\sa120 Modified duties (surface, parts crib) started 07/04/2026 at 4 hrs/day, now 6. Supervisor Marty Toivonen (705 555 0118, mtoivonen@onapingridge.example) confirms accommodation is available to the end of May. Target: regular duties, underground, by June 15, 2026. Restrictions on the attached Functional Abilities Form: no lifting over 15 kg, no overhead reach on the right, no operating vibrating equipment more than 2 hrs/shift. Ga\u233?tan drives 50 minutes each way from Chelmsford; mileage claim sent separately.\par}
{\pard\sb180\sa80\b\fs24 Recommendations\par}
{\pard\sa120 Extend Program of Care by 1 block (8 visits over 4 weeks). Orthopaedic consult only if strength plateaus. Discharge planned mid-June.\par}
